| PWA with Vite | https://github.com/vitejs/vite-plugin-pwa |
| Accessibility audit | https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.1 |

---

### Quick Start Script

If you want a ready‑made starter, clone this repo:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-org/ecommerce-frontend-starter.git
cd ecommerce-frontend-starter
npm install
npm run dev
```

It comes pre‑configured with:

- Vite + React + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS + Headless UI
- Zustand for state
- Axios wrapper
- Basic pages (Home, ProductDetail, Cart)
- Storybook + Jest + Cypress

Feel free to fork and adapt it to your needs.

---

Happy coding! 🚀 If you hit a snag or need help with a specific part (e.g., integrating Stripe, setting up GraphQL, or optimizing bundle size), just let me know.
